Hello,

I will post in this thread my apps which are useless except for understanding and/or explaining some basic Shiny functioning.

Here is the first one; it illustrates isolate() as well as actionButton(): http://glimmer.rstudio.com/stla/Isolate_example1/

The showfiles() function is defined in global.R, which contains nothing else :
library(shinyAce)
showfiles <- function(){
  list(
    aceEditor("server",
              value = paste(readLines("server.R"), collapse="\n"),
              mode="r", theme="cobalt", height="260px",
              readOnly=TRUE),
    aceEditor("ui",
              value = paste(readLines("ui.R"), collapse="\n"),
              mode="r", theme="cobalt", height="400px",
              readOnly=TRUE)
    )
}

